sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-przemyslaw-allometric-compound-leaf> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-przemyslaw-allometric-compound-leaf-overall> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (MorphoEval Autonomous Loop Slot 037 Pass 2 Assessor)" ;
        dcterms:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf orcid:0009-0007-4948-9192 ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-przemyslaw-allometric-compound-leaf-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Bilsborough et al. (2011), Barkoulas et al. (2008), Vlad et al. (2014) & Kierzkowski et al. (2019) growing leaf margin PIN1-Auxin-CUC2-RCO feedback loop and serration vs compound leaflet dissection — MorphoEval overall 93.0/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Pass 2 (v2) evaluation of `2011-przemyslaw-allometric-compound-leaf.py` (overall weighted score: 93.1/100, up from 54.4/100 in v1). The remediated script couples the Bilsborough et al. (2011) epidermal Auxin–PIN1–CUC2 feedback PDE with 2D leaf margin contour outgrowth and Vlad et al. (2014) / Kierzkowski et al. (2019) RCO sinus growth repression; verifies Law 1 CUC2-promoted up-the-gradient PIN1 polarization (residual 0.0) and complementary spatial antiphase between Auxin tooth peaks and CUC2 sinus maxima (r = -0.9908); proves Law 2 smooth margin collapse in `cuc2-1` loss-of-function (I_D = 0.0120) and `cuc2-1D` unrepressed uniform CUC2 (I_D = 0.0250); reproduces the 6-genotype dissection depth sweep across *Arabidopsis* and *Cardamine hirsuta* (Pearson r = 0.9983, p = 4.58e-6, RMSE = 0.0169) and intercalary peak insertion across stages P3–P6 (1, 3, 5, 7 peaks); and segments the SHA-256-locked *Cardamine hirsuta* compound leaf specimen (`cardamine_hirsuta_compound_leaf_specimen.jpg`, 32 leaflet lobes, perimeter dissection ratio 4.0939, empirical I_D = 0.5202 +- 0.0128 SE). Overall 93.0/100 (faithfulness 92.8, reproducibility 93.4); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 94, Morphological realism / specimen match 92, Parameter expressivity 92, Morphometric validation 93, Source and data traceability 95, Code-to-model traceability 92, Reproducibility package 93. Output judged: docs/media/allometric_compound_leaf_comparison.png: rendered output of 2011-przemyslaw-allometric-compound-leaf.py at 8871db0, image/png, 840528 B, 2475×1530 px, artifact_sha256 30950e8ff4f1ba0f81bf3b9566ec639fb6cf32e5c5f2525ed0ed4a5ea42a0ab8 (sha256 30950e8ff4f1ba0f81bf3b9566ec639fb6cf32e5c5f2525ed0ed4a5ea42a0ab8), spec_fingerprint f7e327f643238b6973cf1043ff1d25ce8c9a027859b313633da11bdc256da7cd. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: f7e327f643238b6973cf1043ff1d25ce8c9a027859b313633da11bdc256da7cd; artifact_sha256: 30950e8ff4f1ba0f81bf3b9566ec639fb6cf32e5c5f2525ed0ed4a5ea42a0ab8; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/allometric_compound_leaf/allometric_compound_leaf_reference.json=fa4f9b265dd83379..., datasets/allometric_compound_leaf/cardamine_hirsuta_compound_leaf_specimen.jpg=1c268fecb3660b31..., datasets/allometric_compound_leaf/paper_citations.bib=8245ac5ad5a33db0..., datasets/allometric_compound_leaf/scout_manifest.json=46ea1539febdb312...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-allometric-compound-leaf-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Bilsborough et al. (2011) PNAS 108:3424-3429 interconnected leaf margin feedback loops: Loop 1 (CUC2 promotes PIN1 up-the-gradient polarization rho_{ij} propto (1 + gamma_CUC2 C_i) exp(beta A_j)), Loop 2 (Auxin represses CUC2 transcription C_i = C_max / (1 + (A_i/K_A)^n), restricting CUC2 to inter-tooth sinuses), and Loop 3 (differential normal margin outgrowth v_n(s) = v_0 [A(s)^m/(K_g^m+A(s)^m)] (1 - eta_sinus C(s)) with intercalary tooth insertion when inter-peak distance exceeds lambda_c) | Vlad et al. (2014) Science 343:780-783 and Kierzkowski et al. (2019) Cell 177:1405-1418 demonstrating that local sinus growth repression by RCO in Cardamine hirsuta converts shallow serrations into deeply incised compound leaflets without changing PIN1/auxin convergence patterning; reconstructed_in_script: 1D/2D growing leaf margin Auxin-PIN1-CUC2-RCO reaction-transport and normal contour outgrowth solver verifying Law 1 up-the-gradient PIN1 promotion (error 0.0 < 1e-15) and strong spatial Auxin-CUC2 antiphase (r = -0.9908), Law 2 smooth margin collapse under cuc2-1 loss-of-function (I_D = 0.0120) and cuc2-1D uniform unrepressed CUC2 control (I_D = 0.0250), and Law 3 RCO-driven compound leaflet dissection across 6 genotypes (Pearson r = 0.9983, p = 4.58e-6, RMSE = 0.0169) and 4 developmental stages P3-P6 (1, 3, 5, 7 peaks) | Automated excess-green chromatic + Euclidean distance-transform segmentation of the SHA-256-locked Cardamine hirsuta botanical specimen (`cardamine_hirsuta_compound_leaf_specimen.jpg`, Public domain, 617x992 px) extracting foliage area fraction (0.3668), 32 compound leaflet lobes, perimeter dissection ratio P/(2*sqrt(pi*A)) = 4.0939, and radial tip-to-sinus dissection index I_D = 0.5202 +- 0.0128 SE; transfer_boundary: 1D epidermal margin reaction-transport coupled to 2D normal leaf contour outgrowth and 2D botanical specimen contour morphometrics; does_not_claim: 3D finite-element adaxial-abaxial lamina thickness mechanics or vascular bundle differentiation inside the rachis." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple the 2D epidermal margin contour PDE to a 3D finite-element cellular vertex mesh with explicit procambial midvein/lateral vein differentiation and anisotropic cell-wall microtubule reinforcement." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.93"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
}

